Third-party code (Android build)
--------------------------------
android/vendor/winit is a modified copy of winit 0.30.13
(https://github.com/rust-windowing/winit), Apache-2.0 License, Copyright (c)
the winit contributors. Two files are modified for handhelds with a built-in
controller, each change marked "AutoGameSoftwareSync (console portable)" in
the source: src/platform_impl/android/keycodes.rs (controller buttons mapped
to interface keys) and src/platform_impl/android/mod.rs (controller axes, hat
and left stick, mapped to arrow keys). See android/vendor/winit/VENDOR-NOTE.md
and android/vendor/winit/LICENSE.

The Android app also links, unmodified, the android-activity, ndk-context,
android_logger and jni crates (MIT / Apache-2.0), in addition to the egui,
eframe and egui-phosphor crates used by the desktop app.
